			},
			"date": "2026-10-14T16:55:43.000Z",
			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://mastodon.social/@jimniels\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>jimniels</span></a></span> <span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> I think we need the browser tab equivalent of a Pythagorean cup. If you open too many tabs it’ll close them all and delete them from your history so you can’t reopen them. Maybe also if you open a duplicate tab.</p>",
			"via": "fediverse"
		},
