			"content": "<p><span class=\"h-card\" translate=\"no\"><a href=\"https://fediverse.zachleat.com/@zachleat\" class=\"u-url mention\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\" target=\"_blank\">@<span>zachleat</span></a></span> Genuinely thank you for this 🙏 On more than one occasion I've found myself pushing 1000+ tabs, I think with this I might be able to _finally_ wrangle it all a bit better!</p><p>I love that it can group stuff up by host, that makes it really easy to clean up some of the tabs in a few clicks, The duplicate finder is nice too 👌</p>",
